{{if eq . "submitting"}}## Submitting Changes

{{if eq $.Workflow "github-flow"}}1. Fork the repository and create a feature branch from `{{$.DefaultBranch}}`.
{{else if eq $.Workflow "git-flow"}}1. Create a feature branch from `develop`.
{{else if eq $.Workflow "trunk-based"}}1. Create a short-lived feature branch from `{{$.DefaultBranch}}` (or commit directly with feature flags).
{{else}}1. Fork the repository and create a topic branch.
{{end}}
2. Make your changes — keep commits small and focused.
3. Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) for the commit message.
{{if $.CLAURL}}4. Sign the [CLA]({{$.CLAURL}}) if you have not already.
{{end}}

{{end}}
